{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-10-07 10:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET APPOINTED BY HARBOR CAPITAL ADVISORS, INC. FOR ETF SERVICING', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE:STT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN APPOINTED AS THE BACK OFFICE SERVICING AGENT FOR HARBOR CAPITAL ADVISORS' FIRST ACTIVELY MANAGED FULLY TRANSPARENT FIXED INCOME ETFS THAT WERE LAUNCHED IN SEPTEMBER IN THE U.S. THE TWO FUNDS ARE THE HARBOR SCIENTIFIC ALPHA INCOME ETF (SIFI), AND THE HARBOR SCIENTIFIC ALPHA HIGH-YIELD ETF (SIHY). AS PART OF THE AGREEMENT, STATE STREET WILL PROVIDE VARIOUS ETF SERVICING SOLUTIONS INCLUDING BASKET CREATIO"}